# Authentication

<!-- User regester -->

## To Register user use this link

http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/register
register user with the following data

```json
{
  "username": "Enter your username",
  "email": "Enter your email",
  "password": "Enter your password"
}
```

## after register get the eamil for veryfication or can ues the token for veryfication

## to verify email use this link

http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/verify-email

with the following data
```
{token}

```

<!--End of user regester -->

<!-- User login -->

## To login user use this link 🔥💧

http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/login

Login user with the fiollowing data

```json
{
  "email": "Enter your Eamil",
  "password": "Enter your password"
}
```

after Login session will start and you can access the protect route with the token

## Forgot password

to reset pssword use this link
http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/forgotpassword
with the following data

```json
{
  "email": "Enter your email"
}
```


